Package: winratioIC
Type: Package
Title: Win Ratio Estimation with Interval and Mixed Censoring
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Zhiguo", "Li", email = "zhiguo.li@duke.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimates win probabilities, loss probabilities, win ratios, and
    weighted-bootstrap uncertainty for two prioritized time-to-event outcomes.
    The current version supports two interval-censored margins and a
    right-censored higher-priority margin with an interval-censored secondary
    margin. A user-selectable lower integration bound permits trimmed and
    untrimmed win-ratio targets. The implementation uses the spline-sieve
    likelihood and win-ratio functionals supplied with the companion methodology.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: splines, stats
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
NeedsCompilation: no
